      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "喜欢隐藏实力的青云天空难得主动向其他赛马娘搭话，\n认真投入并跑练习。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c20226c37d99b203a143a5e965cd61949321726680e1ac7b37afa90a36f6c3fc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
